   Having finally won this great game, I have a couple questions for more 
experienced hackers...

1) What does the artifacts column in the WCTS Spoiler mean??? There are no
headings for two of the columns.  (Wondering what exactly my +8 Excalibur was
doing)

2) What are the best rings to have?  I had regen, conflict, levit, and +5 prot.
Anything else I'm missing?

3) What all does a shield of reflection reflect?  I noticed almost everything
whizzing past me...

4) What all does magic resistance resist? My +6 GDSM must have saved me from at
least 100 polymorph traps and level teleporters...

5) How is experience calculated for monsters?  I knew asmodeus would be worth
a lot, but I had no idea how much... (p.s. Orcus has a wand of death on him...)

6) The earliest experience levels are by far the most hazardous...which is
best if you get one wish fairly early -- good weapon or good armor?

7) Does a cursed amulet of life saving still work?

8) Is there such a thing as a spellbook of identify?

9) How is nutrition affected by voluntary and involuntary teleports?

